cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ChemLink in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "ChemLink: a modular orchestration platform for molecular docking and dynamics on HPC clusters"
abstract: >-
  ChemLink automates molecular docking (fpocket, Meeko/AutoGrid4, AutoDock-GPU,
  AutoDock Vina, LightDock) and molecular dynamics (GROMACS, gmx_MMPBSA)
  workflows behind a single command-line interface, on a single node or
  distributed through SLURM job arrays.
